      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my flight from LHR to singapore just got cancelled. im stuck at heathrow right now and need to get to sin asap. can u help me figure out what i should look for in new flights so i dont spend like 30 hours traveling? what should i prioritize?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
