      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Prioritize non-stop flights first—Singapore Airlines and British Airways both fly LHR–SIN direct, so check those before anything else. If no direct seats remain, look for one-stop options with short layovers (under 3 hours) in hubs like Dubai, Doha, or Frankfurt. Avoid anything with a layover longer than 4 hours unless it’s the only option, and always filter by total travel time under 18 hours. Also, ask the airline to rebook you for free since it’s their cancellation—don’t pay out of pocket.",
